  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Point it at a manuscript package folder and it runs a local audit pipeline. The result is a bilingual (English/Chinese) report with an R0–R4 risk level, audit coverage, missing materials, claim-to-evidence coverage, figure-to-raw traceability, and an action tracker the team can edit. It never gives a pass/fail or misconduct verdict. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
